            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2553] Whenever the SECC performs the \"Full Handshake\" (as described in 7.7.3.5) to setup a TLS session (as described in 7.7.3.3, 7.7.3.4 and 7.7.3.5), it shall calculate a new hash by following [V2G20-2630].",
            "block_bbox": [
                70,
                741,
                1053,
                820
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    70.0,
                    741.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    741.0
                ],
                [
                    1053.0,
                    820.0
                ],
                [
                    70.0,
                    820.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2633] When the SECC receives a SessionID value in the SessionSetupReq that is equal to a SessionID value stored from a preceding V2G communication session that has not been terminated yet, the SECC should calculate the SHA512 hash of the SessionID received in SessionSetupReq message concatenated with the hash generated by [V2G20-2553].",
            "block_bbox": [
                68,
                917,
                1054,
                1050
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
