        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2635] After a successful \"Initial Handshake\" (as described in 7.7.3.5) to setup a TLS session (as described in 7.7.3.3, 7.7.3.4 and 7.7.3.5), the EVCC should calculate SHA512 hash of the SECC certificate (only the leaf certificate not the entire certificate chain) or, in case of a private SECC, PE certificate (only the leaf certificate not the entire certificate chain).",
